    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71942" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀγδό-ᾰτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, poet. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄγδοος,</span> as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρίτατος</span>
