			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				68
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀ. δεκάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Rev.Phil.</u>
					22.357
				</span></i>
