				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				772
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				790
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καθ᾽ ὁγδοάδην δεκάδα</span>
			prob. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Jahresh.</u>
				23
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Beibl.</u>
				402
			</span></i>(<span class="entity">Egypt</span>)).</div>
